Feature: Material 3 Expressive UI Transformation
  As a player
  I want the app to feature Material 3 Expressive design system elements
  So that the visual experience feels ultra-premium, tactile, dynamic, and deeply immersive

  Scenario: Expressive spring motion on card interaction
    Given any action card displayed in gameplay
    When the player presses down on the card
    Then the card smoothly compresses with bouncy spring physics
    And expands back with a 3D flip animation on release

  Scenario: Multi-layer tonal surfaces and asymmetric shapes
    Given any screen in the application
    When elements are rendered
    Then background surfaces use M3 Expressive tonal containers
    And cards feature expressive asymmetric geometry
